== Effects ==
* Spawns a blue fly [[familiar]] that will follow Isaac's movement with a 1-second delay and fires tears at nearby enemies.
** {{dlc|r}} Papa fly follows Isaac on a 0.66 second delay instead.
* Papa Fly's tears deal Isaac's damage, and are fired once per second.
* {{transformation contribution|Beelzebub}}

== Notes ==
* Since Papa Fly's damage scales off of Isaac's own damage, any item that provides a massive damage increase (such as {{i|Ipecac}} or {{i|Polyphemus}}) will prove benefitial.

== Synergies ==
* {{dlc|r}} {{I|Multidimensional Baby}}: Papa Fly will always shoot two shots due to both of them having the same movement delay.

